{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id1510181447"}, "name":{"label":"Giulio costa4"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-14T00:45:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"14.29.0"}, "id":{"label":"14425776340"}, "title":{"label":"Serious Concerns About Fraudulent Accommodation Listings on Agoda"}, "content":{"label":"Dear Agoda Team,\n\nI am very disappointed with my experience using your accommodation booking app. The reason is that there are currently many sophisticated scams involving accommodation listings on the platform.\n\nSome listings provide very reasonable information, attractive photos, and suitable locations. However, when travelers arrive at their destination, they may suddenly find that their booking has been canceled or that the accommodation does not actually exist. This can cause significant stress and inconvenience, especially when traveling to another city or country.\n\nI believe Agoda should strengthen its verification and monitoring procedures for accommodation providers, including hotels, apartments, and privately operated properties. This would help protect customers and ensure that travelers can use Agoda with greater confidence without worrying about accommodation scams.\n\nI sincerely hope Agoda will take this issue seriously and take stronger measures to protect its customers.\n\nThank you for listening to my feedback.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=440676901&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
